# libpulse recycles packets through a process-wide lock-free free list
# (pulsecore/packet.c: PA_STATIC_FLIST_DECLARE(packets, ...)); its atomics
# are in libpulsecommon, which is not instrumented, so ThreadSanitizer
# sees a packet one context freed and another reused as a race. Only
# calls made from inside that library are suppressed.
called_from_lib:libpulsecommon
